# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent-harness runtime state
#
# Per-user or per-session state from the local agent harnesses. The
# project-shared shape stays tracked (OPENWOLF.md, cerebrum.md, config.json,
# identity.md, reframe-frameworks.md, hooks/*.js, hooks/package.json,
# .claude/rules/openwolf.md, .claude/settings.json, AGENTS.md) — those
# define the protocol every contributor sees. Anything below is local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OpenWolf — auto-rebuilt or per-session state
.wolf/anatomy.md
.wolf/buglog.json
.wolf/memory.md
.wolf/token-ledger.json
.wolf/cron-manifest.json
.wolf/cron-state.json
.wolf/daemon.log
.wolf/designqc-report.json
.wolf/designqc-captures/
.wolf/suggestions.json
.wolf/hooks/_session.json

# Claude Code — per-user runtime
.claude/agents/
.claude/logs/
.claude/metadata/
.claude/tmp/

# Other agent harnesses — per-user state
.codex/
.entire/

# Cursor — per-user IDE state. Shared configs (e.g. .cursor/rules/*.mdc,
# .cursor/mcp.json) are tracked; runtime hook state is not.
.cursor/hooks/state/
